{"about_the_game":"Roll, jump, and smash your way through this tropical 2D platformer.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664640/extras/e7cd2a435f882706de0f6ceb4de6be27.webp?t=1590263992\" width=608 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664640/extras/94e8b5973ddc1fe62aafc24f2f157516.avif?t=1590263992\" width=608 height=160 /></span><br>Kuila has invaded Leilani's island with her robot army. She seems to think the island is a good power source, but doesn't care if she destroys it in the process. There's only one option - smash everything in sight and kick her off the island!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664640/extras/efe2068cd0005390bb59282585154dbd.webp?t=1590263992\" width=608 height=50 /></span><br>Leilani isn't agile on her feet, but she makes up for it with her rolling skills. Roll to go faster, roll along tightropes, roll through tubes!<br><br>Kuila's robot army - plus some of the island's own dangerous creatures - will try to stop Leilani. But why avoid them when you can make use of them? Kick the enemies into each other, roll into them to start a chain reaction, or jump off them to get higher.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664640/extras/b195f19bcd67ef53b0f8da0b0819c638.webp?t=1590263992\" width=608 height=50 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A whole island of levels to beat - with many secret level exits and hidden routes to find.<br></li><li>Elemental powerups - create a bubble to float over danger or turn into a fireball to speed up and smash things faster.<br></li><li>Minimal cutscenes and no dialogue - just gameplay from start to finish.<br></li><li>Original Soundtrack by Leila 'Woofle' Wilson.</li></ul><br>The game is still in development so please look forward to future announcements!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/664640?t=1590263992","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664640/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1590263992","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1590263992","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1590263992","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Roll, jump, and smash your way through this tropical 2D platformer.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664640/extras/e7cd2a435f882706de0f6ceb4de6be27.webp?t=1590263992\" width=608 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664640/extras/94e8b5973ddc1fe62aafc24f2f157516.avif?t=1590263992\" width=608 height=160 /></span><br>Kuila has invaded Leilani's island with her robot army. She seems to think the island is a good power source, but doesn't care if she destroys it in the process. There's only one option - smash everything in sight and kick her off the island!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664640/extras/efe2068cd0005390bb59282585154dbd.webp?t=1590263992\" width=608 height=50 /></span><br>Leilani isn't agile on her feet, but she makes up for it with her rolling skills. Roll to go faster, roll along tightropes, roll through tubes!<br><br>Kuila's robot army - plus some of the island's own dangerous creatures - will try to stop Leilani. But why avoid them when you can make use of them? Kick the enemies into each other, roll into them to start a chain reaction, or jump off them to get higher.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664640/extras/b195f19bcd67ef53b0f8da0b0819c638.webp?t=1590263992\" width=608 height=50 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A whole island of levels to beat - with many secret level exits and hidden routes to find.<br></li><li>Elemental powerups - create a bubble to float over danger or turn into a fireball to speed up and smash things faster.<br></li><li>Minimal cutscenes and no dialogue - just gameplay from start to finish.<br></li><li>Original Soundtrack by Leila 'Woofle' Wilson.</li></ul><br>The game is still in development so please look forward to future announcements!","developers":["Ishisoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664640/header.jpg?t=1590263992","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Craig Forrester 2014-2018","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/664640/189042/e58ea8d962d2bb8ea537bf8ffcb66c8a78da3ee7/1751127196/dash_av1.mpd?t=1538847713","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/664640/189042/e58ea8d962d2bb8ea537bf8ffcb66c8a78da3ee7/1751127196/dash_h264.mpd?t=1538847713","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/664640/189042/e58ea8d962d2bb8ea537bf8ffcb66c8a78da3ee7/1751127196/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1538847713","id":256731410,"name":"Early Gameplay #2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256731410/movie.293x165.jpg?t=153884771